    "detailed_description": "Humanity's last chance.<br><br>Enlist in the Legion and fight for freedom against a tyrant in a galaxy far, far away in this fierce, frantic, treacherous and fast-paced third-person shooter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME A HERO</h2>You will join a squad of up to six Warriors who must exterminate the followers of the tyrant Nihilus with a bomb or through teamwork.<br>Take care of your allies \u2014 betrayal and friendly fire is a sad fact of this crusade, but it is impossible to win without working as a team.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THREATS</h2>Nihilus is a being that has surpassed the level of superiority of an ordinary human. Extremely powerful, he can invoke natural disasters to make the work of the Legion's warriors difficult. But don't worry, as long as you stay in the safe zone that Vegner, the mad scientist, has prepared, you will be safe from all of Nihilus' attempts to exterminate your ship. However... Don't think you are completely safe, as Nihilus' followers are waiting, waiting for the right moment to overpower you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CONSCIOUS PLANET</h2>Tup\u00e3 is a conscious planet that has become humanity's refuge. He is on your side, trying to protect the life that lives within you. Please save humanity!",
